  "body": "[![WhiteSource Renovate](https://app.renovatebot.com/images/banner.svg)](https://renovatebot.com)\n\nThis PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Change | Age | Adoption | Passing | Confidence |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| [enzyme-to-json](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json) | [`3.4.4` -> `3.6.2`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/enzyme-to-json/3.4.4/3.6.2) | [![age](https://badges.renovateapi.com/packages/npm/enzyme-to-json/3.6.2/age-slim)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) | [![adoption](https://badges.renovateapi.com/packages/npm/enzyme-to-json/3.6.2/adoption-slim)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) | [![passing](https://badges.renovateapi.com/packages/npm/enzyme-to-json/3.6.2/compatibility-slim/3.4.4)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) | [![confidence](https://badges.renovateapi.com/packages/npm/enzyme-to-json/3.6.2/confidence-slim/3.4.4)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>adriantoine/enzyme-to-json</summary>\n\n### [`v3.6.2`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/releases/v3.6.2)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/compare/v3.6.1...v3.6.2)\n\n-   Merge pull request [#&#8203;181](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/issues/181) from SiemvandenBerg/bump-lodash-vulnerability  [`b309142`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/b309142)\n-   update yarn lock file  [`220e58f`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/220e58f)\n-   bump lodash from 4.17.15 to 4.17.21 to fix vulnerabilities  [`ffe1480`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/ffe1480)\n-   Merge pull request [#&#8203;177](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/issues/177) from adriantoine/dependabot/npm_and_yarn/ini-1.3.7  [`4287bdd`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/4287bdd)\n-   Merge pull request [#&#8203;176](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/issues/176) from adriantoine/dependabot/npm_and_yarn/handlebars-4.7.6  [`fe3a7e9`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/fe3a7e9)\n-   Merge pull request [#&#8203;175](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/issues/175) from adriantoine/dependabot/npm_and_yarn/yargs-parser-13.1.2  [`cf81e75`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/cf81e75)\n-   Merge pull request [#&#8203;174](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/issues/174) from adriantoine/dependabot/npm_and_yarn/codecov-3.7.1  [`5ad9733`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/5ad9733)\n-   Merge pull request [#&#8203;173](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/issues/173) from adriantoine/dependabot/npm_and_yarn/node-fetch-2.6.1  [`8ba572d`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/8ba572d)\n-   Merge pull request [#&#8203;179](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/issues/179) from adriantoine/dependabot/npm_and_yarn/y18n-4.0.1  [`705a935`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/705a935)\n-   Bump y18n from 4.0.0 to 4.0.1  [`7cfba07`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/7cfba07)\n-   Bump ini from 1.3.5 to 1.3.7  [`b23eb4c`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/b23eb4c)\n-   Bump handlebars from 4.5.1 to 4.7.6  [`8ecb838`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/8ecb838)\n-   Bump yargs-parser from 13.1.1 to 13.1.2  [`1a280ce`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/1a280ce)\n-   Bump codecov from 3.6.1 to 3.7.1  [`f96b37e`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/f96b37e)\n-   Bump node-fetch from 2.6.0 to 2.6.1  [`54ce25e`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/54ce25e)\n\n### [`v3.6.1`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/releases/v3.6.1)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/compare/v3.6.0...v3.6.1)\n\n-   Merge pull request [#&#8203;172](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/issues/172) from chyzwar/fix-cherio-type  [`b80ae29`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/b80ae29)\n-   fix(): fix cherio types following DT changes  [`63f4026`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/63f4026)\n\n### [`v3.6.0`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/releases/v3.6.0)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/compare/v3.5.0...v3.6.0)\n\n-   Merge pull request [#&#8203;171](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/issues/171) from nathanmarks/add-memo-support  [`6d326a5`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/6d326a5)\n-   remove only  [`33a39f0`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/33a39f0)\n-   handle deep mounted memo components properly  [`a149fb0`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/a149fb0)\n-   Merge pull request [#&#8203;170](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/issues/170) from RamyaPayyavula/patch-2  [`a4f83d3`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/a4f83d3)\n-   Update package.json  [`1ce6532`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/1ce6532)\n\n### [`v3.5.0`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/releases/v3.5.0)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/compare/v3.4.4...v3.5.0)\n\n-   Merge pull request [#&#8203;167](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/issues/167) from mmarcuccio/mount-deep-exclude-forward-ref  [`866547a`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/866547a)\n-   Exclude forward ref on deep mount  [`356c30c`](https://togithub.com/adriantoine/enzyme-to-json/commit/356c30c)\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: \"after 4pm on friday,before 9am on monday,every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Disabled due to failing status checks.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR becomes conflicted, or you tick the rebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box.\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [WhiteSource Renovate](https://renovate.whitesourcesoftware.com). View repository job log [here](https://app.renovatebot.com/dashboard#github/algolia/instantsearch.js).",
